# The .htaccess of shared/ and backups/ in the site folder on the server.
# bin/deploy.sh uploads it on every deploy. The rewrite rule of
# server/root.htaccess already hides both folders. This file also denies
# every request, so Apache serves no file from them if that rule is lost.
# www/media is a symlink into shared/media. Apache looks for .htaccess files
# along the path of the request, not along the target of a symlink. The
# images under /media/ therefore still load.

Require all denied
